{"version":1,"content":"<p>受到地磁活動影響，黑龍江省多地（如漠河、阿木塔旅遊度假區、塔河縣）10月11日凌晨觀測到北極光。</p><p>而黑龍江大慶市與伊春市亦曾於10月4日晚間捕捉到極光蹤影。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T11:58:06.606628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:15:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:38.718768+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"1363389334b88504b6765d8c5a6daaa234c56711886e8e8e4676a538d8968c7b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}